    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "ジョーダン発見！　ここで会ったが幾星霜！\r\n伊達巻の“伊”の形にしてやるぜーーッ！",
            "enText": "Aha — Jordan! We meet again, after\ncountless eons! I'm gonna roll you up\nlike a <i>datemaki</i>!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 2408399816737003833,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "はぁ！？　急になんなん……！？",
            "enText": "Huh?! What are you talking about?!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 5518758963638704496,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "言い残したことはねぇか……？\r\nオマエはこれから、アタシの指先1つで――",
            "enText": "Do you have any last words?\nWith the flick of a finger, I will—",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4046014508793782960,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "って、うおおおぉ～～！？\r\n指の爪が欠けてる～っ！？",
            "enText": "OOOOW! My nail chipped!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 1354498550457261509,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "えっ、ちょっ、見してみ！",
            "enText": "Really? Let me see it!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -3854920113292632224,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "……ふう、深くないし問題ないっしょ。\r\nやすり貸すから削っとき？",
            "enText": "…Phew, at least it's not that deep.\nHere, I'll lend you my nail file.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 8571749055345405408,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "ベースとかトップコートとかもやっとく？\r\nほら、こんな感じで？",
            "enText": "Do you wanna put on a base and\ntop coat too? Look, like this?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -8727420088221939025,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "おお……うおおおお～！？\r\nこんなところに逸材が眠ってやがった！",
            "enText": "Huh? …Whoooaaa! We've got a genius in\nour midst and I didn't even know it!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 1906096784395446437,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "なあジョーダン、大会に出ようぜ！\r\nゴルシ様がエントリーしといてやる！",
            "enText": "You know what, Jordan? You should enter a\ncontest! I, the mighty Golshi, shall handle all\nthe entry paperwork!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 5812345221305813552,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "大会！？　ゆーてプロじゃないけど、\r\nまあプロ級には、やれてっし？\n……いっちょかましとく？",
            "enText": "A contest?! I'm not a pro or anything…\nBut now you mention it, I <i>am</i> kinda pro level.\nI could try, I guess?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 401511216746283319,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "その意気だ！　町内プラモデル大会で、\r\nオマエのプラモデラー魂を燃やせェ～～～！！",
            "enText": "That's the spirit! Show them your burning\npassion at the miniature town model contest!!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -2320455786651813994,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "いやネイルの話どこいったし！？",
            "enText": "Weren't we talking about nails?!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -8738859179171756794,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
